## Key Concepts

- Region-local SageMaker endpoints behind PrivateLink
- Per-tenant routing policy and IAM constraints
- Canary rollouts and rollback triggers for model changes
- Model drift detection and automated validation loops
- Autoscaling with target tracking and predictive policies
- Cost optimization through instance selection and spot utilization

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code: route request to region-local endpoint with tenant guardrails
function routeToRegionalEndpoint(request, tenantConfig) {
  const region = request.region;
  const endpoint = tenantConfig.endpoints[region];

  // Validate tenant access and route via PrivateLink
  if (validateTenantAccess(request.tenantId, endpoint)) {
    return invokeViaPrivateLink(endpoint, request.content);
  }

  throw new Error('Unauthorized access or endpoint unavailable');
}
```
